<title>USA: DM Management Co Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>DM Management Co Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>HINGHAM, Mass. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Periods ended Dec 28</p>
<p>				    1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $2.38     loss	 $0.12</p>
<p> Net profit		11,313     loss	   491</p>
<p> Revs			22,783		   16,955</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 4,747		    4,262</p>
<p>Year</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.72     loss	 $0.20</p>
<p> Net profit		 3,371     loss	   881</p>
<p> Revs			84,642		   78,532</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 4,679		    4,416</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 and year nets include tax benefit of $10.6 million, related to net operating loss carry forwards.</p>
<p>Q4 oper shr profit $0.15 vs loss $0.07, and for year profit $0.38 vs loss $0.07.</p>
<p>Figures include losses from discontinued operations of $205,000 in 1995 Q4, and $9.0 million vs $590,000 in year.</p>
<p>Company changed its fiscal year-end from the last Saturday in June to the last Saturday in December.</p>
